### Login to Obtain JWT Token
POST http://localhost:8086/login_gateway/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reachus@zealoustechcorp.com",
  "password": "Zactacademy@2013"
}

# Note: Copy the "token" from the response and replace <your_jwt_token> in subsequent requests.

###

### Health Check (Unprotected)
GET http://localhost:8086/health

###

### Create User
POST http://localhost:8086/user_gateway/user/add_user
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>

{
  "full_name": "student_1",
  "department": "Computer Science Engineering",
  "college": "Muthayammal Engineering College",
  "rollno": "22CS001",
  "email": "student1@gmail.com",
  "mobile_no": "+919876513210"
}

